Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NightDrivingInFoggyCondition" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to fog and night conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:billboard1 a :Billboard .
:billboard2 a :Billboard .
:trafficLight a :TrafficLight .
:trafficSign a :TrafficSign .
```

